- Run: git rm --cached .deckent/cache/managed-docs-cache.json
- File stays on disk, just untracked from git index

### Step 2: Update src/orchestra/managed-docs/doc-cache.ts
- Add DocCacheMetadata interface
- Update DocCache type to include optional _meta
- Update writeDocCache to auto-insert _meta
- Update readDocCache to handle _meta transparently (filter from returned entries if needed)
