### Step 4: Create tests/orchestra/gitignore-invariant.test.ts
- Test 7 gitignored paths are NOT tracked in git
- Use execSync('git ls-files .deckent/') and verify patterns

### Step 5: Verify
- tsc --noEmit
- npx vitest run

